    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Edward Carey Property is delighted to present this fantastic family home superbly located at Kilshanroe, a short distance from Johnstown Bridge & Enfield - in the heart of the County Kildare countryside. This great home, extending to a generous 176 sq.m / 1,894 sq.ft & standing on a great site of c0.5 acre which would benefit from some modernization, is ideal for the expanding family with a lovely country style feel to the kitchen, the separate & cosy family/TV room, and the large formal living/dining room, and not to forget the large integrated block built garage, and the property is not overlooked to the front or rear. \n\nApproached by a tarmacaddamed driveway, with large, but easily maintained gardens, Kilshanroe could not be better. \n\nThe area is super - a short distance to Kilshanroe church & primary school, & the larger towns of Enfield & Johnstown Bridge are each within easy reach and provide a full range of educational, shopping, transport & commercial activities & services. Edenderry is within about 15 mins & provides a great wider range of all services & amenities. Viewing is a must. \n\nAre you bidding on one of our properties, new to the market, unsure of the procedure? Check out my website https://www.edcarey.ie/useful-information/ for a helpful guide on buying & selling with us.\n\nTo bid on this property, please go to my website www.edcarey.ie, find the listing & hit the 'Offr' button to bring you to the registration field. I'll then approve your registration and you can bid at your convenience. \n\nOutside \ntarmacaddamed driveway. Front & rear gardens & great large shed/fuel store"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall (10.46m x 3.13m) with tiled flooring, ceiling coving<br>Sitting Room (4.26m x 3.70m) with wooden flooring, stove, TV point<br>Kitchen (6.03m x 4.46m) large country style kitchen with great range of fitted kitchen cabinets & appliances included<br>Utility Room (3.17m x 2.97m) with rear back door & range of fitted cabinets<br>Living Room (7.33m x 4.35m) large living room with open fireplace & carpet flooring<br>Bathroom (4.35m) with tiled flooring, bath, wc, whb, bidet<br>Bedroom 1 (4.35m x 3.55m) with built-in wardrobes<br>Bedroom 2 (4.25m x 3.44m) with built-in wardrobes<br>En-suite with shower & whb<br>Bedroom 3 (3.55m x 3.44m) with built-in wardrobes<br>Bedroom 4 (3.35m x 3.04m) with built-in wardrobes<br>Integrated Garage (8.26m x 6.08m) "
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Great 4 bed, 2 bath detached family home, c176 sq.m / 1,895 sq.ft\nLarge integrated garage, c8.26sq.m x 6.08 sq.m\nSuper countryside location at Kilshanroe\nShort distance to Johnstown Bridge & Enfield villages\nGreat family home\nWould benefit from some modernisation\nTarmacaddamed driveway, c0.5 acre grounds\nOFCH, mains water, septic tank\nProperty built 1984. BER C, potential A\n\n\n"
      },
